#
# The move manifest of change 0117 (gateway package layout), which the move
# driver (scripts/refactor) applies one step at a time with -step.
#
# Format: one move per line, three tab-separated fields:
#     <old import path>\t<new import path>\t<step>
# Lines beginning with '#' and blank lines are comments. A line names the
# directory that moves; the packages nested under it move with it, and the
# driver rewrites their import paths with the same line.
#
# Each line moves a package from its directory today to the directory of its
# part in the layout of change 0117, "SP-1 The package tree", or out of
# pkg/gateway to a concern directory under pkg/. The part of every package,
# and the step that moves it, come from tests/registers/gateway-layout.yaml,
# and TestManifestAgreesWithTheLayoutRegister holds the two in agreement.
# Packages that a member change of the v1 program removes have no line; step
# 0117.S13 adds lines for what such a change leaves.
#
# The new paths keep each package's name as its last segment. Each move step
# settles the names of the packages it moves (decision 6 of change 0117): a
# step that renames a package edits its line here before it runs the driver.
# The manifest stays committed after its moves run, as the translation table
# for any text that still names an old path.


